      "title_cn": "Anthropic 高付费客户超 1.19 万家，净收入留存率达 900%",
      "title_en": "Anthropic tops 11,900 high-paying customers, net revenue retention about 900%",
      "title_original": "Anthropic 高付费客户超 1.19 万家，净收入留存率达 900%",
