      "category": "ai",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "what_happened": "Anthropic 披露，截至 2026 年 9 月 30 日净收入留存率约 900%；年消费不低于 10 万美元的客户超 11,900 家（一年前约 950 家），超 1,900 家达 100 万美元，约 250 家达 1,000 万美元及以上。",
      "what_happened_en": "Anthropic said that as of September 30, 2026 its net revenue retention was about 900%, with over 11,900 customers spending at least $100,000 annually (about 950 a year earlier), over 1,900 at $1 million and about 250 at $10 million or more.",
      "why_it_matters": "Claude Code 是关键驱动：使用该工具的头部 5% 企业客户月均支出约为未使用者的 20 倍，显示编程智能体正拉动企业 AI 支出。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "Claude Code is a key driver: top 5% Claude Code enterprise users spend about 20x monthly versus non-users, showing coding agents pull enterprise AI spending.",
