      "original_language": "zh",
      "what_happened": "苹果自 2026 年 10 月 29 日起通知部分德国政府工作人员和议员，其 iPhone 可能成为商业间谍软件攻击目标；德国联邦信息安全局建议收到警告者假定设备已被入侵。",
      "what_happened_en": "Apple began notifying some German government staff and lawmakers from October 29, 2026 that their iPhones may be targeted by mercenary spyware; Germany's BSI advised recipients to assume compromise.",
      "why_it_matters": "这表明商业间谍软件仍威胁政府设备，但受影响人数及幕后黑手尚未披露。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "It shows commercial spyware remains a threat to government devices, though the number affected and the attacker are undisclosed.",
