      "title_cn": "我国超深地下工程装备获突破，国内首套超深竖井智能焊接成套装备投用",
      "title_en": "China's First Intelligent Welding Equipment Set for Ultra-Deep Shafts Enters Service",
      "title_original": "我国超深地下工程装备获突破，国内首套超深竖井智能焊接成套装备投用",
      "source": "IT之家",
      "published_at": "2026-11-02T23:16:36+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/021/292.htm",
      "category": "other_tech",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "what_happened": "据央视报道，三峡集团确认我国首套专用于超深竖井的压力钢管智能焊接成套装备在浙江松阳抽水蓄能电站正式投用。该竖井总深637米，焊接效率较传统手工焊提升65%以上，焊缝一次性合格率达99%。",
      "what_happened_en": "According to CCTV, China Three Gorges Corporation confirmed that China's first intelligent welding equipment set dedicated to ultra-deep shaft pressure steel pipes entered service at the Songyang pumped-storage power station in Zhejiang. The shaft is 637 meters deep; welding efficiency is over 65% higher than manual welding and the first-pass weld qualification rate reaches 99%.",
      "why_it_matters": "该装备补齐超深竖井高强钢钢管自动化焊接短板，标志我国超深地下工程装备自主化取得新进展。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The equipment fills a gap in automated welding of high-strength steel pipes in ultra-deep shafts, advancing self-reliance in ultra-deep underground engineering equipment.",
